+# SM80 CUDA knowledge base
+
+FlashRT SM80 enablement of OpenBMB/ForgeKernel at
+`b2c8ae8510e02c28576808910a6b8827721ab7dc` (Apache-2.0).
+
+This tree contains no certified recipes. Every generated recipe requires
+measurement and numerical validation on the allocated target GPU.
+
+GA100 uses `compute_80` / `sm_80`, HMMA (`mma.sync`), LDSM (`ldmatrix`) and
+LDGSTS (`cp.async`). It has no TMA, WGMMA, tcgen05 or FP8 tensor cores.
+Use PM sampling intervals of at least 20000 cycles. Insufficient samples remain
+a failed or partial profiling observation.
