+# SM80 CuTe DSL knowledge base
+
+FlashRT SM80 enablement of OpenBMB/ForgeKernel at
+`b2c8ae8510e02c28576808910a6b8827721ab7dc` (Apache-2.0).
+
+This tree contains no certified recipes. CuTe DSL availability and device
+compilation must be checked for the installed GPU runtime version.
+
+Set `CUTE_DSL_ARCH=sm_80`. GA100 uses HMMA, LDSM and LDGSTS; it has no TMA,
+WGMMA, tcgen05 or FP8 tensor cores. Use PM sampling intervals of at least
+20000 cycles. These configuration changes do not establish kernel correctness
+or performance.
